+						        *E1589*
+The directory is created with permissions 700.  If it already exists, it must
+be a directory (not a symlink), owned by the user and not accessible by group
+or others, otherwise E1589 is given and no socket is created or used there.
+The socket itself is created with permissions 700.
 
